QQOIqhRUmK2-o7i0WsM5sdXH1xlILg&oe=6AFC9583"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Horizon Stream for Playstation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Turn your Meta Quest into the ultimate gaming display! **Horizon Stream** is a dedicated, open-source PlayStation Remote Play client built specifically for the Meta Quest ecosystem. \n\nWhether you want to play fast-paced shooters on a massive, theater-sized virtual screen or lay back and enjoy immersive RPGs while staying aware of your surroundings in mixed reality, this app delivers a seamless and highly optimized remote play experience straight from your PS4 or PS5.\n\n### Key Features:\n* **High-Performance Streaming:** Enjoy crisp, low-latency gameplay at 1080p (and HDR 4K on supported PS5 connections) with buttery-smooth 60fps frame rates.\n* **Immersive Virtual Displays:** Resize, reposition, and curve your screen anywhere in your physical space using Meta Quest's seamless window management.\n* **Native Controller Support:** Connect your DualSense or DualShock 4 controller directly to your headset via Bluetooth for precise, zero-compromise input.\n* **Open Source:** Fully transparent, ad-free, and community-driven. Horizon Stream complies with the AGPLv3 license and is built upon the renowned `chiaki-ng` project.\n\n*Disclaimer: This application is a third-party, open-source client. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Sony Interactive Entertainment. \"PlayStation\", \"PS5\", and \"PS4\" are registered trademarks of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc.*", "short_description": "Experience your favorite PlayStation 4 and PlayStation 5 games on massive virtual screens in your Meta Quest headset with low-latency remote play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/0TheRain0/horizonstream/blob/main/meta_store_assets/privacy_policy.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CMSoft", "support_websi